      "text": "Step 5c: Specimen Contact Consensus\nFOR each specimen: collect segments with contact_mass ≥ 0.45\nAggregator: mean_contact_dist, alpha = 1.0\n→ fully replace individual with consensus contact distribution\nPreserve ambient/contact mass ratio per segment",
