    {
      "id": "pp-detail-txt",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 690,
      "y": 1315,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 510,
      "text": "Key Parameters (tuned on OOF grid search):\n\nBlend: highsr_weight=0.80, pairwise_weight=0.20\n\nSegment grouping: rule=sum_log_proba\nAggregates log-prob per class across windows in segment\n\nSpecimen consensus: threshold=0.45, alpha=1.0\nmin_contact_segments=1, agg_rule=mean_contact_dist\n\nLift parameters: lift_min_mass=0.35\nlift_floor=0.58, lift_confidence=0.45\n\nTuning methodology:\nGrid search over all combinations using train OOF\nSelection score = 0.60 × macro + 0.30 × contact + 0.10 × binary\nNO robot/test data used during tuning",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "strokeColor": "#1b1b1b",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "version": 2,
      "versionNonce": 1836913134,
