      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1783365857612,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Key Parameters (tuned on OOF grid search):\n\nBlend: highsr_weight=0.80, pairwise_weight=0.20\n\nSegment grouping: rule=sum_log_proba\nAggregates log-prob per class across windows in segment\n\nSpecimen consensus: threshold=0.45, alpha=1.0\nmin_contact_segments=1, agg_rule=mean_contact_dist\n\nLift parameters: lift_min_mass=0.35\nlift_floor=0.58, lift_confidence=0.45\n\nTuning methodology:\nGrid search over all combinations using train OOF\nSelection score = 0.60 × macro + 0.30 × contact + 0.10 × binary\nNO robot/test data used during tuning",
